#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:15
msgid "Your {app} code"
msgstr ""

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:16
msgid ""
"Your code is {code}. It expires in ten minutes.\n"
"\n"
"If you did not ask for it, ignore this email."
msgstr ""

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:31
msgid "No {app} account for this email"
msgstr ""

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:32
msgid ""
"Someone, likely you, tried to log in to {app} with this email. There is no account for it, and {app} is not taking new sign-ups right now: log in with the email you signed up with.\n"
"\n"
"If this was not you, ignore this email."
msgstr ""

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:48
msgid "Your code to delete your {app} account"
msgstr ""

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:53
msgid ""
"Your code is {code}. It expires in ten minutes. Entering it deletes your account and everything in it, and cannot be undone.\n"
"\n"
"If you did not ask for it, someone is logged in to your account: log in and change your password."
msgstr ""

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:68
msgid "Your {app} account was deleted"
msgstr ""

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:69
msgid ""
"Your {app} account and everything in it were deleted, as you asked. A plan bought in the App Store is billed by Apple until you cancel it in your Apple ID's subscriptions.\n"
"\n"
"You can sign up again with this email at any time."
msgstr ""

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:85
msgid "Your password was changed"
msgstr ""

#: core/src/services/mailer/mails.rs:86
msgid ""
"The password of your {app} account was just set.\n"
"\n"
"If this was not you, log in with a code sent to this email and change it, then check who else can read your email."
msgstr ""
